"``speculative_num_steps`` / ``speculative_num_draft_tokens``. An explicitly "
"provided ``speculative_algorithm`` is left untouched."
msgstr ""
"Se traduce a ``--speculative-algorithm NEXTN`` con los valores "
"correspondientes de ``speculative_num_steps`` / "
"``speculative_num_draft_tokens``. Un ``speculative_algorithm`` explícito se "
"conserva."

